  {
    "id": 2014004110010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、今日もおつかれさま☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040140010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bgm": "016",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈こそ、お疲れ様\r\n最近、休めてないけど疲れてないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈は全然大丈夫\r\nプロデューサーさんがいてくれるし☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこまで信頼してもらえて、嬉しいよ\r\nこれからも全力でやってくから、よろしくな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！　よろしくね、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、そうそう、甘奈ね\r\n今楽しみにしてることがあるんだ☆",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "アイドルとしての活動が\r\nどこまで楽しくなるんだろーって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それを考えるとね\r\nもっともっと頑張ろーってなっちゃうんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近の甘奈からは、すごくパワーを感じるよ\r\n今の甘奈も、充実した顔をしてるしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "充実かぁ……確かにそうかも\r\nでも、きっとそれはみんなからパワーをもらってるからだよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "特に、プロデューサーさんからはね☆\r\n……と、そろそろ何か頼まないとだよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "はい、プロデューサーさん、メニューどうぞ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、ありがとう\r\n何にするかな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、迷っちゃうよね☆\r\n甘奈はどうしよっかな～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あ、このソフトクリーム、前に食べたやつだ！\r\n美味しかったなー",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "せっかくだし\r\n甘奈はまた、これにしよーかな☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、じゃあ俺もそれにしよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ、じゃあこれふたつね☆\r\n店員さーん！　お願いしまーす",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110130"
  },
