  {
    "id": 2014004110140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でもさ、こうやって、プロデューサーさんと\r\nファミレスでゆっくりするの、なんか久しぶりだよね",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ちょっと前まではこうしてることも結構あったから\r\n甘奈、ちょっと嬉しいかも",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今は忙しくなってきたもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、こうやって忙しくできるのは\r\n甘奈が頑張ってくれてるからだぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへっ、ありがと",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110160"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……えーっとね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "off",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n甘奈、プロデューサーさんに言っておきたいことがあるんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈がアイドル目指したきっかけ\r\n最初にプロデューサーさんに話したよね？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "005",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、聞いた\r\n甜花の可愛さをみんなに知ってほしかったんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん。甜花ちゃんに輝いてほしいっていう気持ちは\r\n今も変わってない",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でもね……それだけじゃなくなったの",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈自身がアイドルとして、思いっきり頑張りたい！\r\nもっと輝いていきたいって、思えるようになったんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……その熱意は俺にも伝わってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……それとね\r\n甘奈、思うんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "その夢を誰かと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それも、自分のことを１番よく知っててくれる人と一緒に\r\n追いかけられるって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110260,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "すっごく、幸せなんだって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから甘奈ね\r\n……アイドルしてる時が、１番幸せ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……大切なファンのみんなが甘奈のことを見てくれて\r\n応援してくれて、喜んでくれて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110290,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "大好きな甜花ちゃんと千雪さんと一緒に\r\nステージに立てて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110300,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そして……何よりも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110310,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……甘奈\r\nこれからも、その夢、一緒に叶え続けていこう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110320,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うんっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110330,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……プロデューサーさん\r\nこれからも甘奈のことよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004110340,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "絶対に、今よりもっと輝くアイドルになってみせるから",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400411/2014004110340"
  },
